# pins of the macOS judge (check/sound/macos/judge.py, entered from the judge scripts on arm64 macOS).
# Lines: PIN <program> <sha256>         a program that build-judge-macos.sh builds on the Mac; other bytes are refused.
#                                       Required for each of the four programs. Where they are on a machine is in
#                                       its record, fastverify/config/pins-macos.env.
#        PIN <name> <sha256> <file>     a file of this tree, named from fastverify/
#        SRC <program> <sha256>         the fingerprint of the sources a program is built from (support.py)
